Dear {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Allergan Moxie Provider Services regarding Case #{!Case.CaseNumber} at {!Account.Name}.

We are pleased to confirm that the requested products are available and your account is in good standing to proceed.

To ensure a smooth treatment experience, please review and complete the following before the scheduled appointment:

1. Confirm the treating provider holds a current, active medical license and is listed on your credentialing record.
2. Ensure each patient has completed and signed Form AM-PC-005 (Patient Consent Form) prior to treatment.
3. At the time of administration, record the product lot number(s) and expiry date(s) in each patient file as required under Form AM-TR-001 (Treatment Record).
4. Any adverse events must be reported within 24 hours of identification using Form AM-AE-003 (Adverse Event Reporting Form).

If you require additional product units for this treatment session, please reply to this email at least 48 hours before the scheduled appointment date.

Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions before the session.

Warm regards,
